{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"img":"chara028_0","mirrow":false,"layer":"chara2","trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"y":-530,"x":170,"scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"addImg":""},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"img":"chara028_0","mirrow":false,"layer":"chara2","trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"y":-530,"x":170,"scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"addImg":""},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"格薇勒","text":"[show]那……那个……{myName}喜欢佳酿吗？我对酿很了解哦……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"格薇勒","text":"[show]因为驿站是契约者的大本营，所以我在驿站经常收集各地冒险家带来的佳酿。[r]久而久之我对深渊里各种品类的佳酿都有所涉猎。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"格薇勒","text":"[show]有些酿很烈，但那种刺激感是无可比拟的。[r]有些酿很清，却也能激起品尝者继续畅饮的欲望。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"格薇勒","text":"[show]世界上的饮品千千万万，能称为佳酿的少之又少。[r]只有像我一样不断品尝各种酿，并且对酿造的过程有着深入研究，才能分别出酿的好与坏。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"格薇勒","text":"[show]所以{myName}在酿这方面又不懂的话……随时可以来问我哦，我们可以一起讨论……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"格薇勒","text":"[show]糟了……得……得意忘形了！对……对对对对不起！[l][cm][hide]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":0,"img":"chara028_0","mirrow":false,"layer":"chara2","trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"y":-530,"x":170,"scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"addImg":""},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"script":"yd_028_04","des":"格薇勒-喜欢喝酒吗？"}